WEBVTT

00:01.103 --> 00:03.241
<i>[upbeat ukulele music]</i>
<i>[欢快的尤克里里音乐]</i>

00:03.310 --> 00:10.241
<i>♪ ♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>

00:10.310 --> 00:13.310
[whistling]
[吹口哨]

00:13.379 --> 00:15.241
[humming]
[嗡嗡声]

00:15.310 --> 00:17.000
Nice work, boy-o.
干得好，小伙子。

00:17.069 --> 00:19.655
She looks cleaner than
a freshly scraped hull.
她看起来比
刚刮过的船体

00:19.724 --> 00:23.103
Oh, hello, Mr. Krabs, I...
[gasps]
哦，你好，蟹老板，我...
[喘气]

00:23.172 --> 00:25.034
Your feet!
你的脚！

00:25.103 --> 00:26.345
Hmm?
唔？

00:27.965 --> 00:30.345
[shivering]
[发抖]

00:30.413 --> 00:31.965
Whew!
That was close.
哇！
那很接近了。

00:32.034 --> 00:34.689
You almost tracked goo all over
your nice, clean restaurant.
你几乎浑身都沾满了粘液
你漂亮、干净的餐厅。

00:34.758 --> 00:37.276
[chuckles]
Good save, huh?
[笑声]
保存得很好吧？

00:37.345 --> 00:39.034
[groans]
[呻吟]

00:39.103 --> 00:40.310
Huh?
啊？

00:40.379 --> 00:43.034
Hmm...
唔...

00:43.103 --> 00:45.551
Oh, looks like this puddle here
is the culprit.
哦，看起来像这里的水坑
是罪魁祸首。

00:45.620 --> 00:46.827
Don't worry, Mr. K.,
别担心，K先生，

00:46.896 --> 00:48.931
I'll have her cleaned up
in no time.
我会让她清理干净
很快。

00:49.000 --> 00:51.345
Hmm...
Aha!
嗯...
啊哈！

00:54.448 --> 00:59.207
[engine turning over, revving]
[发动机转动、加速]

00:59.276 --> 01:00.689
[gargling]
[漱口]

01:00.758 --> 01:04.862
Okay, you just pour this
in here, and...
好的，你只要倒这个
在这里，还有……

01:04.931 --> 01:07.448
Huh?
[screams]
啊？
[尖叫声]

01:07.517 --> 01:09.793
"It's a beautiful day,"
you said.
“这是美好的一天，”
你说。

01:09.862 --> 01:13.000
"Why not do some evil science
outside?" you said.
“为什么不做一些邪恶的科学呢？
外面？”你说。

01:13.069 --> 01:14.345
SpongeBob!
海绵宝宝！

01:14.413 --> 01:17.482
What in Neptune's navel
are you doing?
海王星的肚脐里有什么
你在做什么？

01:20.138 --> 01:21.586
Oh, sorry, Plankton.
哦，对不起，浮游生物。

01:21.655 --> 01:24.000
I was just cleaning up
this goo puddle for Mr. Krabs.
我刚刚打扫卫生
这个粘糊糊的水坑是给蟹老板的。

01:25.620 --> 01:28.034
That doesn't look like goo.
这看起来不太像。

01:28.103 --> 01:30.241
It looks like oil.
看起来像油。

01:30.310 --> 01:32.448
Holy moly, Karen!
天啊，凯伦！

01:32.517 --> 01:34.827
We're sittin'
on a mountain of moolah!
我们坐着
在金钱之山上！

01:34.896 --> 01:36.034
[screaming]
[尖叫]

01:36.103 --> 01:37.689
That oil's mine, you hear?
那油是我的，听到了吗？

01:37.758 --> 01:40.965
My employee found it,
and besides,
我的员工发现了，
除此之外，

01:41.034 --> 01:42.482
it's on me property!
这是我的财产！

01:42.551 --> 01:45.034
Not so fast, Krabs.
没那么快，蟹蟹。

01:45.103 --> 01:46.655
That's my oil,
这是我的油

01:46.724 --> 01:49.034
and it's on my property!
这是我的财产！

01:49.103 --> 01:52.103
[both grunting]
[两人都咕哝着]

01:52.172 --> 01:53.896
[both growl]
[双方咆哮]

01:58.551 --> 02:01.276
Mmm.
Actually, you're both wrong.
嗯。
事实上，你们都错了。

02:01.345 --> 02:03.413
It's not oil at all.
它根本不是油。

02:03.482 --> 02:04.482
both: It's not?
两人：不是吗？

02:04.551 --> 02:06.551
According to my analysis,
根据我的分析，

02:06.620 --> 02:09.207
it's a combination
of Krabby Patty grease
这是一个组合
蟹黄饼油脂

02:09.276 --> 02:10.793
and Chum runoff,
和密姆径流，

02:10.862 --> 02:13.069
which your two restaurants
have been leaking
你们的两家餐厅是哪一家
已经泄漏

02:13.138 --> 02:15.034
into the ground for decades.
埋入地下数十年。

02:15.103 --> 02:18.724
So it's just
worthless old grease?
所以这只是
旧油脂毫无价值？

02:18.793 --> 02:20.379
I wouldn't call it
"worthless."
我不会这么称呼它
“一文不值。”

02:20.448 --> 02:22.620
It has a high viscosity index
它具有高粘度指数

02:22.689 --> 02:25.724
and impressive flavor-imparting
characteristics.
以及令人印象深刻的风味
特点。

02:25.793 --> 02:28.207
So its "worthful"?
那么它“值得”吗？

02:28.276 --> 02:29.724
Yes, however,
是的，但是，

02:29.793 --> 02:32.448
the deposit appears to be
evenly split
押金似乎是
均分

02:32.517 --> 02:34.689
between your restaurants.
您的餐厅之间。

02:34.758 --> 02:36.724
Well, Plankton, looks like
嗯，浮游生物，看起来像

02:36.793 --> 02:38.758
if we want to make
a lot of money...
如果我们想做
很多钱...

02:38.827 --> 02:41.517
We'll have to do it as...
我们必须这样做...

02:41.586 --> 02:44.034
[groans]
both: Partners.
[呻吟]
两者：伙伴。

02:48.138 --> 02:49.689
Come on, Krabs.
来吧，蟹蟹们。

02:49.758 --> 02:52.862
There's got to be some use
for this stuff we can agree on.
总得有点用处
对于这些事情我们可以达成一致。

02:52.931 --> 02:55.000
Mm, let's sell it
to the military!
嗯嗯，卖掉吧
到军队！

02:55.069 --> 02:58.793
Imagine...
fuel for flamethrowers,
想象一下...
火焰喷射器的燃料，

02:58.862 --> 03:01.448
<i>lubricant for killer robots,</i>
<i>杀手机器人的润滑剂，</i>

03:01.517 --> 03:04.448
<i>bombs that smell
like French fries!</i>
<i>有气味的炸弹
就像炸薯条一样！</i>

03:04.517 --> 03:06.207
<i>[laughs]</i>
<i>[笑]</i>

03:06.276 --> 03:07.827
all: Mmm.
全体：嗯。

03:09.379 --> 03:11.931
We'll use it to boost
business at The Krusty Krab...
我们将用它来增强
蟹堡王 (Krusty Krab) 的生意...

03:12.000 --> 03:14.138
<i>a flavorful new sandwich topping</i>
<i>美味的新三明治配料</i>

03:14.207 --> 03:16.276
<i>a savory new milkshake,</i>
<i>美味的新奶昔，</i>

03:16.345 --> 03:18.965
<i>and a lovely new scent
for the restrooms.</i>
<i>还有可爱的新香味
用于洗手间。</i>

03:19.034 --> 03:20.034
[all sniffing]
[大家都在嗅闻]

03:20.103 --> 03:21.413
Oh, no!
哦，不！

03:21.482 --> 03:24.379
We're not using my grease
to drive customers
我们没有使用我的油脂
带动客户

03:24.448 --> 03:25.862
to your restaurant!
到你的餐厅！

03:25.931 --> 03:27.379
- Oh, you...
- Why, I ought to...
- 哦，你...
- 为什么，我应该...

03:27.448 --> 03:31.207
[both grunting]
[两人都咕哝着]

03:31.276 --> 03:34.103
Oh, gosh, I don't see why
you need to find just one use
哦，天哪，我不明白为什么
你只需要找到一种用途

03:34.172 --> 03:35.276
for this stuff.
对于这个东西。

03:35.345 --> 03:37.482
I started using it
for everything.
我开始使用它
对于一切。

03:37.551 --> 03:39.276
- What?
- Huh?
- 什么？
- 啊？

03:39.345 --> 03:41.345
<i>Toothpaste,</i>
<i>牙膏，</i>

03:41.413 --> 03:43.448
<i>bodywash, deodorant,</i>
<i>沐浴露、除臭剂</i>

03:43.517 --> 03:44.758
<i>shoe polish,</i>
<i>鞋油，</i>

03:44.827 --> 03:46.413
<i>all-night face mask,</i>
<i>整夜面膜，</i>

03:46.482 --> 03:47.517
<i>Gary's breakfast,</i>
<i>加里的早餐，</i>

03:47.586 --> 03:49.862
<i>my own breakfast.</i>
<i>我自己的早餐。</i>

03:49.931 --> 03:52.138
<i>It even cured my bursitis!</i>
<i>它甚至治愈了我的滑囊炎！</i>

03:52.207 --> 03:53.551
What I mean is,
我的意思是，

03:53.620 --> 03:55.620
if you can use it for anything,
如果你能用它来做任何事

03:55.689 --> 03:57.931
why not sell it for everything?
为什么不把它全部卖掉呢？

03:57.100 --> 03:59.931
<i>[cash register bell dings]</i>
<i>[收银机铃响]</i>

03:59.100 --> 04:02.207
<i>[cash register bell dings,
horn toots]</i>
<i>[收银机铃声响起，
喇叭嘟嘟声]</i>

04:05.655 --> 04:07.069
Not bad.
不错。

04:07.138 --> 04:09.655
Well, we better get some
customers here, Eugene.
好吧，我们最好买一些
这里的顾客，尤金。

04:09.724 --> 04:11.896
I was up all night
painting that sign.
我整夜没睡
画那个标志。

04:11.965 --> 04:14.413
Have a little faith, Plankton.
要有一点信心，浮游生物。

04:14.482 --> 04:15.482
[gasps]
[喘气]

04:15.517 --> 04:18.103
Behold, the lunch rush!
看哪，午餐高峰期！

04:18.172 --> 04:21.034
[humming]
[嗡嗡声]

04:21.103 --> 04:23.345
[both scream]
[两人尖叫]

04:23.413 --> 04:25.655
Whoa!
哇！

04:30.241 --> 04:33.241
[all groaning]
[全都呻吟]

04:33.310 --> 04:34.655
[giggles]
[咯咯笑]

04:34.724 --> 04:36.758
Time to get to work!
- [laughs]
是时候去上班了！
- [笑]

04:36.827 --> 04:37.931
[babies crying]
[婴儿哭声]

04:37.100 --> 04:40.276
[screams]
[尖叫声]

04:40.345 --> 04:42.965
Pardon me, ma'am,
but how about some
请原谅我，女士，
但一些怎么样

04:43.034 --> 04:46.069
Dr. Krabton's Miracle
Everything Juice
克拉布顿博士的奇迹
一切果汁

04:46.138 --> 04:49.172
to quiet the little angels?
[grunts]
让小天使安静下来？
[咕哝]

04:51.482 --> 04:52.931
[sighs]
[叹气]

04:54.241 --> 04:56.517
[grunts]
Hmm...
[咕哝]
嗯...

04:56.586 --> 04:57.931
[groans]
[呻吟]

04:57.100 --> 05:01.551
why, Dr. Krabton
can fix up your boat for you!
为什么，克拉布顿博士
可以为您修理您的船！

05:01.620 --> 05:02.862
See?
看？

05:02.931 --> 05:04.827
There you go.
Good as new.
就这样吧。
完好如新。

05:04.896 --> 05:06.931
Say, it really works!
说吧，确实有效！

05:06.100 --> 05:09.931
Three cheers
for Everything Juice!
三声欢呼
一切果汁！

05:09.100 --> 05:12.758
all: Hooray!
全体：万岁！

05:12.827 --> 05:15.034
[indistinct chatter]
- We'll take one!
[模糊的喋喋不休]
- 我们要一个！

05:15.103 --> 05:18.034
[excited chatter]
[兴奋的喋喋不休]

05:18.103 --> 05:20.517
<i>[upbeat music]</i>
<i>[欢快的音乐]</i>

05:20.586 --> 05:21.100
<i>♪ ♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>

05:22.069 --> 05:24.931
Look at all this cash, Krabs!
看看这么多现金，蟹蟹们！

05:24.100 --> 05:27.896
We're rich!
- Not rich enough.
我们有钱了！
- 不够富有。

05:27.965 --> 05:30.793
We got to take our show
on the road!
我们必须参加我们的表演
在路上！

05:30.862 --> 05:33.345
[boat beeping]
[船的嘟嘟声]

05:33.413 --> 05:34.758
All right, Plankton.
好吧，浮游生物。

05:34.827 --> 05:37.100
Let a real salesman show you
how it's done.
让真正的推销员告诉你
它是如何完成的。

05:38.069 --> 05:39.689
[doorbell rings]
[门铃响]

05:39.758 --> 05:42.172
Eugene?
What a surprise.
尤金？
真是一个惊喜。

05:42.241 --> 05:45.207
Uh, we don't have
a lunch date today, do we?
呃，我们没有
今天有一个午餐约会，可以吗？

05:45.276 --> 05:48.827
Not with me.
Your date today is with value.
不和我在一起。
你今天的约会很有价值。

05:48.896 --> 05:51.758
Suppose I told you
there was one product
假设我告诉你
有一种产品

05:51.827 --> 05:54.172
that could fuel
all your boats...
这可以燃料
你所有的船...

05:55.862 --> 05:57.345
[engines rev]
Reinvigorate
[发动机转速]
重振活力

05:57.413 --> 06:00.586
old lighthouse paint jobs...
- [grunts]
旧灯塔油漆工作...
- [咕哝]

06:04.517 --> 06:06.793
And even cover up those...
[clears throat]
甚至掩盖那些...
[清嗓子]

06:06.862 --> 06:10.241
Maturation lines
around your eyes.
成熟线
你的眼睛周围。

06:10.310 --> 06:11.655
Plank.
板。

06:11.724 --> 06:13.413
<i>♪ ♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>

06:13.482 --> 06:15.310
How dare you?
你怎么敢？

06:15.379 --> 06:17.689
Give me ten bottles.
给我十瓶。

06:17.758 --> 06:20.069
You did pretty good
back there, Krabs.
你做得很好
回到那里，蟹蟹。

06:20.138 --> 06:23.586
But now it's time
to watch a master!
但现在是时候了
来围观高手！

06:23.655 --> 06:25.655
Ooh, gladly.
[doorbell rings]
哦，很高兴。
[门铃响]

06:25.724 --> 06:29.448
Let me know when he gets here.
[laughs]
当他到达这里时请告诉我。
[笑]

06:29.517 --> 06:32.034
- Howdy.
- Greetings, Sandra.
- 你好。
- 你好，桑德拉。

06:32.103 --> 06:35.413
I am here to tell you
about our latest invention.
我来这里是为了告诉你
关于我们的最新发明。

06:35.482 --> 06:37.241
It'll fertilize your lawn.
它会给你的草坪施肥。

06:37.310 --> 06:38.793
[grunts goofily]
[愚蠢地咕哝]

06:38.862 --> 06:41.413
Polish your dome glass...
擦亮你的圆顶玻璃...

06:41.482 --> 06:42.517
Oh.
哦。

06:42.586 --> 06:45.724
[hums]
- [chirping]
[哼哼]
- [叽叽喳喳]

06:46.724 --> 06:51.172
And give even your oldest
nuts that fresh-picked shine!
甚至给你最年长的
新鲜采摘的坚果闪闪发光！

06:51.241 --> 06:52.482
[snickers]
[窃笑]

06:52.551 --> 06:53.827
[grunts]
[咕哝]

06:53.896 --> 06:58.345
It's Dr. Krabton's
Miracle Everything Juice!
这是克拉布顿博士的
奇迹一切果汁！

06:58.413 --> 07:01.138
[fanfare plays]
[吹奏乐曲]

07:01.207 --> 07:03.379
I ain't some hayseed, Plankton.
我不是干草籽，浮游生物。

07:03.448 --> 07:04.689
I'm a scientist.
我是一名科学家。

07:04.758 --> 07:06.310
I don't believe in miracles.
我不相信奇迹。

07:06.379 --> 07:09.448
Well, but it can also keep
oxygen machines running
嗯，不过还可以保留
制氧机运行

07:09.517 --> 07:11.138
in top shape!
处于最佳状态！

07:11.207 --> 07:12.138
Huh...
呃……

07:12.207 --> 07:15.069
[machine wheezing and coughing]
[机器喘息和咳嗽]

07:15.138 --> 07:18.793
Well, I do like breathin'.
嗯，我确实喜欢呼吸。

07:18.862 --> 07:20.100
I'll take a whole case!
我要接整个案子！

07:21.069 --> 07:23.172
This door-to-door stuff's
taking too long.
这种挨家挨户的事情
花了太长时间。

07:23.241 --> 07:25.586
We got to go big!
- How big?
我们必须做大！
- 有多大？

07:25.655 --> 07:28.345
Musical big!
音乐剧大！

07:28.413 --> 07:31.310
[upbeat music plays]
[欢快的音乐响起]

07:31.379 --> 07:33.793
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

07:33.862 --> 07:36.965
[crowd oohing]
[人群欢呼]

07:37.034 --> 07:39.345
♪ Hey, there, mister,
would you like to know ♪
♪ 嘿，先生，
你想知道吗♪

07:39.413 --> 07:41.103
♪ About a very
a special something ♪
♪ 关于一个非常
特别的东西♪

07:41.172 --> 07:43.241
♪ That makes
all your problems go away? ♪
♪ 这使得
你所有的问题都消失了吗？ ♪

07:43.310 --> 07:44.310
What is it?
它是什么？

07:44.379 --> 07:45.758
- It's Everything Juice.
- What?
- 一切都是果汁。
- 什么？

07:45.827 --> 07:48.034
♪ Hey, there, madam,
can I help you out ♪
♪ 嘿，女士，
我可以帮你吗 ♪

07:48.103 --> 07:49.517
♪ With those
false teeth of yours ♪
♪ 与那些
你的假牙♪

07:49.586 --> 07:51.965
♪ It must be very hard
to shout hooray ♪
♪ 一定很难
欢呼万岁♪

07:52.034 --> 07:54.138
- [screams]
- ♪ For Everything Juice ♪
- [尖叫]
- ♪ 一切果汁 ♪

07:54.207 --> 07:58.103
♪ Can it make my voice
sound much more creepy? ♪
♪ 它能发出我的声音吗
听起来更令人毛骨悚然？ ♪

07:58.172 --> 08:00.620
- Probably.
- ♪ Will it fix the smell ♪
- 大概。
- ♪ 它能消除气味吗 ♪

08:00.689 --> 08:02.758
♪ Of my pet Kiki? ♪
♪ 我的宠物琪琪？ ♪

08:02.827 --> 08:04.310
- Buy it and see!
- Indeed!
- 买来看看！
- 的确！

08:04.379 --> 08:06.793
♪ Hey, there, son,
looks like you might need ♪
♪ 嘿，儿子，
看起来你可能需要 ♪

08:06.862 --> 08:08.379
♪ To find some
slickening solution ♪
♪ 寻找一些
光滑液♪

08:08.448 --> 08:11.448
♪ So your marbles
can get up to speed today ♪
♪ 所以你的弹珠
今天可以跟上进度了♪

08:11.517 --> 08:12.965
Try Everything Juice!
尝试一切果汁！

08:13.034 --> 08:16.069
♪ Pardon me,
but I see you chose ♪
♪ 请原谅我，
但我看到你选择了♪

08:16.138 --> 08:17.631
♪ Not to trim that
rather lengthy hair ♪
♪ 不要修剪它
头发比较长♪

08:17.655 --> 08:20.689
♪ Protruding from your nose,
but that's okay ♪
♪ 从你的鼻子里伸出来，
但没关系♪

08:20.758 --> 08:22.241
With Everything Juice!
一切果汁！

08:22.310 --> 08:24.586
- How much does it cost?
- Quite a lot!
- 它要多少钱？
- 相当多！

08:24.655 --> 08:26.551
<i>[cash register bell dings]</i>
- I don't care.
<i>[收银机铃响]</i>
- 我不在乎。

08:26.620 --> 08:28.310
Give me everything you've got.
把你拥有的一切都给我。

08:28.379 --> 08:31.103
both: ♪ Yes, my friends,
this is the greatest stuff ♪
两人：♪ 是的，我的朋友们，
这是最伟大的东西♪

08:31.172 --> 08:32.862
♪ It's a wonder,
it's a miracle ♪
♪ 这是一个奇迹，
这是一个奇迹♪

08:32.931 --> 08:33.941
♪ You just can't have enough ♪
♪ 你就是不够 ♪

08:33.965 --> 08:35.482
♪ So we say hey ♪
♪ 所以我们说嘿 ♪

08:35.551 --> 08:36.100
♪ Get some today ♪
♪ 今天就买一些 ♪

08:37.069 --> 08:38.345
♪ There's no excuse ♪
♪ 没有任何借口 ♪

08:38.413 --> 08:41.827
♪ Everyone needs
Everything Juice ♪
♪ 每个人都需要
一切都是果汁♪

08:41.896 --> 08:45.034
[crowd clamoring]
[人群喧闹]

08:45.103 --> 08:46.827
<i>[cash register bell dings]</i>
<i>[收银机铃响]</i>

08:46.896 --> 08:50.172
<i>A million one, a million two,</i>
<i>一百万一，一百万二，</i>

08:50.241 --> 08:51.862
a million three.
一百万三。

08:51.931 --> 08:56.413
Eugene, is this what
friendship feels like?
尤金，这是什么？
友谊是什么样的感觉？

08:56.482 --> 09:00.655
Perhaps it is, Sheldon.
Perhaps it is.
也许是的，谢尔顿。
也许是的。

09:00.724 --> 09:04.310
both: Money fight!
[giggling]
两人：金钱战！
[咯咯笑]

09:04.379 --> 09:05.459
[elevator bell dings]
- Huh?
[电梯铃声]
- 啊？

09:05.517 --> 09:08.310
[all yelling]
[大家大喊]

09:08.379 --> 09:10.655
Hey!
What are you all doing in here?
嘿！
你们都在这里做什么？

09:10.724 --> 09:12.241
[all yelling]
[大家大喊]

09:12.310 --> 09:14.517
We are unsatisfied customers!
我们是不满意的顾客！

09:14.586 --> 09:17.034
Just look at what your grease
did to my air!
看看你的油脂是什么
对我的空气做了什么！

09:17.103 --> 09:20.207
[yelling continues]
[喊叫继续]

09:22.207 --> 09:23.276
all: Ew.
所有人：呃。

09:23.345 --> 09:25.345
Your grease gave me pink eye!
你的油脂让我红了眼睛！

09:25.413 --> 09:27.620
Well, at least your...
[clears throat]
好吧，至少你的...
[清嗓子]

09:27.689 --> 09:30.172
Maturation lines are gone.
成熟线消失了。

09:30.241 --> 09:31.241
[grunts]
[咕哝]

09:31.276 --> 09:34.724
I'll take two more bottles.
我再拿两瓶。

09:34.793 --> 09:36.034
No more!
不再！

09:36.103 --> 09:38.207
You two have ruined
the whole town!
你们两个毁了
整个城镇！

09:38.276 --> 09:41.862
all: We want our money back!
全体：我们要回我们的钱！

09:41.931 --> 09:43.689
Huh?
[chuckles nervously]
啊？
[紧张地笑]

09:43.758 --> 09:45.827
[whimpers]
[呜咽]

09:45.896 --> 09:48.689
[sighs]
I knew you would mess this up.
[叹气]
我就知道你会把事情搞砸的。

09:48.758 --> 09:50.586
You always mess things up.
你总是把事情搞砸。

09:50.655 --> 09:52.069
Me?
我？

09:52.138 --> 09:55.551
I'm not the one who came up
with that lousy song.
我不是上来的人
和那首糟糕的歌。

09:55.620 --> 09:57.965
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

09:58.034 --> 10:00.034
[pump wheezes]
[泵喘息声]

10:00.103 --> 10:01.310
Must be running low on grease.
一定是油脂不足了。

10:01.379 --> 10:04.345
Oh, well, it wasn't me
who sold it
哦，好吧，那不是我
谁卖的

10:04.413 --> 10:07.413
as fire extinguisher
recharging fluid.
作为灭火器
充电液。

10:07.482 --> 10:08.413
All right, all right.
好吧，好吧。

10:08.482 --> 10:10.413
But I'm not the one who sold it
但我不是卖它的人

10:10.482 --> 10:13.448
as acne treatment
to high schoolers.
作为痤疮治疗
给高中生。

10:13.517 --> 10:17.793
Oh, but you did market it
as drinkable vitamins!
哦，但你确实推销过它
作为可饮用的维生素！

10:17.862 --> 10:19.448
That's it!
就是这样！

10:19.517 --> 10:21.896
This friendship is over!
这段友谊就结束了！

10:21.965 --> 10:24.413
We are mortal enemies once more!
我们又是不共戴天的敌人了！

10:24.482 --> 10:25.931
Fine by me!
对我来说很好！

10:25.100 --> 10:29.413
I don't want to see you
ever again, ever!
我不想见你
再来一次，永远！

10:29.482 --> 10:31.103
[doors slam]
[关上门]

10:31.172 --> 10:32.620
<i>[suspenseful music]</i>
<i>[悬疑音乐]</i>

10:32.689 --> 10:34.965
Whoa, whoa.
[screams]
哇哦，哇哦。
[尖叫声]

10:35.034 --> 10:37.827
[groans]
[呻吟]

10:37.896 --> 10:39.793
This is all your fault!
这都是你的错！

10:39.862 --> 10:41.758
You trapped us in here!
你把我们困在这里了！

10:41.827 --> 10:44.620
Oh, I wish I'd never met you!
哦，我希望我从未遇见过你！

10:44.689 --> 10:46.551
That goes double for me!
这对我来说是双倍的！

10:46.620 --> 10:48.448
Oh, boy!
哦，孩子！

10:48.517 --> 10:52.172
The three best friends
buried alive together forever,
三个最好的朋友
永远活埋在一起，

10:52.241 --> 10:54.241
and it's all thanks to...
而这一切都归功于...

10:54.310 --> 10:57.345
♪ Everything Juice ♪
♪ 一切果汁 ♪

♪ 一切果汁 ♪